keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - protein sequences
  - Fourier transform
  - periodicity analysis
abstract: >-
  Modern browser-based re-implementation of the FT tool for the
  identification of residue periodicities in protein and nucleotide
  sequences, using a WebAssembly port of the original C FFT pipeline.
